  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "RealMobile",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tRealMobile \u2014 Model Trajectories\n\t\n\nAgent execution trajectories on the RealMobile benchmark \u2014 a real-device benchmark for mobile GUI agents. Each trajectory is one model attempting one task on a physical Android phone driving live Chinese applications (Bilibili, Douyin, Xiaohongshu, Weibo, Taobao, QQ Music, Ctrip, AMap, Hema, \u2026), recorded step by step: screenshot, UI-hierarchy XML, the action taken, and the model's reasoning.\nThis dataset accompanies the Xiaomi-GUI-0 technical\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/SeerRay-Lab/RealMobile.",
